sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RT as Red Team Student
    participant WS as WebSocket Server
    participant SB as Sandbox Manager
    participant SC as Scenario Container
    participant FB as Filebeat
    participant ES as Elasticsearch
    participant SE as SIEM Engine
    participant BT as Blue Team Student
    participant AI as AI Monitor

    Note over RT,AI: Phase: Exploitation â€” sqlmap execution

    RT->>WS: stdin frame: {type:stdin, data:base64(sqlmap -u ...)}
    WS->>SB: Route to container PTY
    SB->>SC: docker exec PTY write
    SC->>SC: Execute sqlmap against target DB
    SC-->>SB: stdout frames (base64 encoded)
    SB-->>WS: stdout stream
    WS-->>RT: {type:stdout, data:base64(output)}

    Note over SC,ES: Defensive Telemetry Pipeline
    SC->>SC: ModSecurity WAF logs SQLi pattern
    SC->>FB: Append to /var/log/modsec_audit.log
    FB->>ES: Ship log document (index: parallax-*)

    Note over ES,BT: Real-Time Blue Team Alert
    SE->>ES: Poll /parallax-*/_search (5s interval)
    ES-->>SE: New WAF alert document
    SE->>SE: Map to SIEM_EVENT schema + MITRE tag
    SE->>WS: Publish to Redis channel siem:{session_id}
    WS-->>BT: {type:siem_alert, severity:high, msg:SQLi detected}

    Note over RT,AI: AI Context Evaluation
    WS->>AI: command_context{command, phase, notes_present}
    AI->>AI: Safety check: no exploit disclosure
    AI-->>WS: Socratic hint (<=150 tokens)
    WS-->>RT: {type:ai_hint, level:2, content:...}

    Note over RT,BT: Scoring Update
    WS->>WS: Record command metadata + score delta
    WS-->>RT: Phase progress update
    WS-->>BT: Score notification
